Project 2: Spotify Music Data Analysis
Objective: To analyze the Spotify-2000 dataset to uncover trends and relationships between various audio features of popular songs and their characteristics.

Tasks Performed:

Data Loading & Inspection: Loaded the Spotify-2000 (2).csv dataset and examined its information.

Data Visualization: Created several plots to visualize different aspects of the data:

plt.bar(): Analyzed the relationship between a song's Year and its Popularity, showing how the popularity of songs has changed over time.

plt.barh(): Visualized the relationship between a song's Title and its Popularity.

plt.scatter(): Explored the relationship between a song's Title and its Artist.

plt.scatter(): Explored the relationship between a song's Artist and its Year.

Key Finding: The analysis effectively demonstrated how the popularity of songs has fluctuated over the years and identified patterns within the dataset, such as which artists were popular in specific years.
